    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Suppose ${{X_n:n\\geq 1}}$ be independent and exponentially distributed with parameter 1. what is the probability $P(\\limsup _{{n \\rightarrow infty}} X_n/\\log(n)=1)? Return a numeric value.\n\nOptions: \nA. 0.5\nB. 1.0\nC. 0.1\nD. 0.36787944117 (1/e)\nE. 0.63212055882 (1 - 1/e)\nF. 0.845350936 (1 - 1/π)\nG. 0.0\nH. 0.69314718056 (1/ln(2))\nI. 0.9\nJ. 0.2\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
