    "global index": "MathQA_167",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: the average salary of the employees in a office is rs . 120 / month . the avg salary of officers is rs . 460 and of non officers is rs 110 . if the no . of officers is 15 , then find the no of nonofficers in the office .\n\nOptions: \nA. 400\nB. 420\nC. 430\nD. 450\nE. 510\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Let the number of non-officers be $ x $.  \nTotal employees = $ 15 $ officers + $ x $ non-officers.  \nAverage salary of all employees is Rs. 120:\n\nSo, total salary = $ 120 \\times (15 + x) $  \nAlso, total salary = (salary of officers) + (salary of non-officers)  \n= $ 460 \\times 15 + 110 \\times x = 6900 + 110x $\n\nSet equal:  \n$ 120(15 + x) = 6900 + 110x $  \n$ 1800 + 120x = 6900 + 110x $  \n$ 10x = 5100 $  \n$ x = 510 $\n\nThus, the number of non-officers is 510.\n\n\\boxed{E}",
      "success": true,
      "token_usage": {
        "input_tokens": 184,
        "output_tokens": 210,
        "total_tokens": 394
      },
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "error": null
    },
    "accuracy": 1.0,
    "cost": 3.4064000000000005e-05
  },
