    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Consider a simple magnetic field which increases exponentially with time, B = B_0e^bta_z where B_0 is constant. Find the electric field produced by this varyingBfield.\n\nOptions: \nA. E = bB_0e^btra_\textphi\nB. E = - (1/2)bB_0e^btra_\textphi\nC. E = - (1/2)bB_0e^bt_\textphi\nD. E = - (1/2)bB_0e^bt\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
