    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following is not a function of guiding plane?\n\nOptions: \nA. Provide one path of insertion and removal of the restoration\nB. Provide stabilizing characteristics against horizontal rotation of denture\nC. Eliminate detrimental strain to abutment teeth during placing or removing restoration\nD. Engage the abutment tooth in such a manner as to resist displacement of restoration away from basal seat\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
