      "generated_answer": "Mark urges his listeners to do something about their problems instead of surrendering to them through suicide, and ultimately encourages them to make their own future. He also tells the students to \"talk hard.\"\n\n\\boxed{He urges his listeners to actively address their problems instead of resorting to suicide and to take control of their own future.}",
