    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Thomas Cole is called the \"Variable Man\" because his presence as a man from the past acts as an unknown, unpredictable factor that confuses the computer calculating Terra's chances of winning the war.\n\n\\boxed{He is an unknown variable that confuses the war-probability computer.}",
      "success": true,
