      "generated_answer": "Elisabeth is initially attracted to a young officer who wishes to marry her. Although she ultimately spurns the officer, Salve has already departed for foreign shores in desperation before they can reconcile.\n\n\\boxed{Salve left for foreign shores in desperation after believing Elisabeth was attracted to a young officer.}",
