    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Homo floresiensis from the island of Flores dates from around 35,000 to 14,000 years ago, and according to some researchers, is similar or related to:\n\nOptions: \nA. Homo neanderthalensis.\nB. Australopithecus afarensis.\nC. Australopithecus africanus.\nD. Homo naledi.\nE. Homo habilis.\nF. Homo ergaster.\nG. Neanderthals.\nH. Homo sapiens.\nI. Homo erectus.\nJ. Homo heidelbergensis.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
