y rates among the French population.\nH. France was at war with multiple other nations.\nI. The proliferation of Enlightenment ideals.\nJ. The French army was too powerful.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
