    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The declaration of war led to massive industrial mobilization that ended the Great Depression in the United States. Because the war decimated the industrial capacity of most other major powers, the United States emerged as a dominant global economic leader in the post-war period. Option H best characterizes this historical outcome.\n\n\\boxed{H}",
